{"seq":2,"slug":"compose-ios-integration","title":"Compose 与 iOS 平台整合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-multiplatform/ui/compose-ios-integration","wordCount":618,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"compose-与-ios-平台整合\">Compose 与 iOS 平台整合</h1><p>在 iOS 上运行 Compose Multiplatform 面临的挑战远超&quot;让代码编译通过&quot;——需要处理原生文本输入、UIKit 控件嵌入、手势系统冲突、无障碍语义映射、以及与 SwiftUI/UIKit 混合使用的互操作场景。Compose Multiplatform 1.11（2026 年 6 月）引入了基于 UITextInput 协议的原生文本实现和完整的 iOS 无障碍支持，标志着 iOS 平台整合进入成熟阶段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Compose 在 iOS 上的运行架构是将 Skia 渲染输出到 CAMetalLayer，同时通过互操作层桥接 iOS 原生能力：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph Compose 渲染管线&#10;        A[Composable 树] --&gt; B[Layout Phase]&#10;        B --&gt; C[Drawing Phase]&#10;        C --&gt; D[Skiko/Skia]&#10;        D --&gt; E[CAMetalLayer]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph iOS 平台桥接&#10;        F[UITextInput 协议] --&gt; G[原生文本输入]&#10;        H[UIViewRepresentable] --&gt; I[UIKit 控件嵌入]&#10;        J[Accessibility Semantics] --&gt; K[VoiceOver]&#10;    end&#10;    A --&gt; F&#10;    A --&gt; H&#10;    A --&gt; J\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph Compose 渲染管线\n        A[Composable 树] --&gt; B[Layout Phase]\n        B --&gt; C[Drawing Phase]\n        C --&gt; D[Skiko/Skia]\n        D --&gt; E[CAMetalLayer]\n    end\n    subgraph iOS 平台桥接\n        F[UITextInput 协议] --&gt; G[原生文本输入]\n        H[UIViewRepresentable] --&gt; I[UIKit 控件嵌入]\n        J[Accessibility Semantics] --&gt; K[VoiceOver]\n    end\n    A --&gt; F\n    A --&gt; H\n    A --&gt; J</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>iOS 集成维度</th>\n<th>1.8 状态</th>\n<th>1.11 状态</th>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>文本输入</td>\n<td>Compose 自绘（体验差）</td>\n<td>原生 UITextInput</td>\n<td>UIView 代理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无障碍</td>\n<td>基础支持</td>\n<td>完整 VoiceOver</td>\n<td>UIAccessibility 映射</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>手势</td>\n<td>基本触摸</td>\n<td>原生手势协调</td>\n<td>UIGestureRecognizer 桥</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>键盘管理</td>\n<td>手动调整</td>\n<td>自动避让</td>\n<td>KeyboardAvoidance</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Deep Linking</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>URL 路由系统</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"原生文本输入-native-text-input\">原生文本输入（Native Text Input）</h2><p>Compose Multiplatform 1.11 最重要的 iOS 改进是原生文本输入。它使用真实的 iOS UIView 通过 <code>UITextInput</code> 和 <code>UIKeyInput</code> 协议管理输入，带来：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>精确的光标移动和选区操作（与原生 Notes 应用一致）</li>\n<li>系统级上下文菜单（自动填充、翻译、搜索）</li>\n<li>原生 iOS 输入法候选词和预测文本</li>\n<li>正确的 dictation（听写）支持</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// commonMain — 文本输入对两个平台透明&#10;@Composable&#10;fun LoginForm(onSubmit: (String, String) -&gt; Unit) {&#10;    var email by remember { mutableStateOf(&quot;&quot;) }&#10;    var password by remember { mutableStateOf(&quot;&quot;) }&#10;&#10;    Column(modifier = Modifier.padding(16.dp)) {&#10;        OutlinedTextField(&#10;            value = email,&#10;            onValueChange = { email = it },&#10;            label = { Text(&quot;邮箱&quot;) },&#10;            keyboardOptions = KeyboardOptions(&#10;                keyboardType = KeyboardType.Email,&#10;                imeAction = ImeAction.Next&#10;            )&#10;        )&#10;        Spacer(modifier = Modifier.height(12.dp))&#10;        OutlinedTextField(&#10;            value = password,&#10;            onValueChange = { password = it },&#10;            label = { Text(&quot;密码&quot;) },&#10;            visualTransformation = PasswordVisualTransformation(),&#10;            keyboardOptions = KeyboardOptions(&#10;                keyboardType = KeyboardType.Password,&#10;                imeAction = ImeAction.Done&#10;            )&#10;        )&#10;        Spacer(modifier = Modifier.height(24.dp))&#10;        Button(onClick = { onSubmit(email, password) }) {&#10;            Text(&quot;登录&quot;)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// commonMain — 文本输入对两个平台透明</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun LoginForm(onSubmit: (String, String) -> Unit) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var email by remember { mutableStateOf(\"\") }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var password by remember { mutableStateOf(\"\") }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Column(modifier = Modifier.padding(16.dp)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        OutlinedTextField(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            value = email,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            onValueChange = { email = it },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            label = { Text(\"邮箱\") },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            keyboardOptions = KeyboardOptions(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                keyboardType = KeyboardType.Email,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                imeAction = ImeAction.Next</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Spacer(modifier = Modifier.height(12.dp))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        OutlinedTextField(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            value = password,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            onValueChange = { password = it },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            label = { Text(\"密码\") },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            visualTransformation = PasswordVisualTransformation(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            keyboardOptions = KeyboardOptions(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                keyboardType = KeyboardType.Password,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                imeAction = ImeAction.Done</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Spacer(modifier = Modifier.height(24.dp))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Button(onClick = { onSubmit(email, password) }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Text(\"登录\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>启用原生文本输入需要在 iOS 入口点配置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// iosMain&#10;fun MainViewController(): UIViewController {&#10;    return ComposeUIViewController(&#10;        configure = {&#10;            platformLayers = true  // 启用平台层渲染&#10;            // 原生文本输入在 1.11 中默认为实验性，需显式开启&#10;        }&#10;    ) {&#10;        App()&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// iosMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun MainViewController(): UIViewController {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return ComposeUIViewController(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        configure = {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            platformLayers = true  // 启用平台层渲染</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            // 原生文本输入在 1.11 中默认为实验性，需显式开启</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        App()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"uikit-控件嵌入\">UIKit 控件嵌入</h2><p>当 Compose 组件无法满足需求时（如 MKMapView、WKWebView、AVPlayerView），可以通过 <code>UIKitView</code> 嵌入原生 UIKit 控件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// iosMain&#10;@Composable&#10;fun NativeMapView(&#10;    latitude: Double,&#10;    longitude: Double,&#10;    modifier: Modifier = Modifier&#10;) {&#10;    UIKitView(&#10;        factory = {&#10;            MKMapView().apply {&#10;                val coordinate = CLLocationCoordinate2DMake(latitude, longitude)&#10;                val region = MKCoordinateRegionMakeWithDistance(coordinate, 1000.0, 1000.0)&#10;                setRegion(region, animated = false)&#10;            }&#10;        },&#10;        update = { mapView -&gt;&#10;            val coordinate = CLLocationCoordinate2DMake(latitude, longitude)&#10;            val region = MKCoordinateRegionMakeWithDistance(coordinate, 1000.0, 1000.0)&#10;            mapView.setRegion(region, animated = true)&#10;        },&#10;        modifier = modifier&#10;    )&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// iosMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun NativeMapView(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    latitude: Double,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    longitude: Double,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    modifier: Modifier = Modifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    UIKitView(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        factory = {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            MKMapView().apply {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                val coordinate = CLLocationCoordinate2DMake(latitude, longitude)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                val region = MKCoordinateRegionMakeWithDistance(coordinate, 1000.0, 1000.0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                setRegion(region, animated = false)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        update = { mapView -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val coordinate = CLLocationCoordinate2DMake(latitude, longitude)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val region = MKCoordinateRegionMakeWithDistance(coordinate, 1000.0, 1000.0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            mapView.setRegion(region, animated = true)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        modifier = modifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>UIKitView 的生命周期管理：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant Compose as Compose Runtime&#10;    participant Bridge as UIKitView Bridge&#10;    participant UIKit as UIKit View&#10;&#10;    Compose-&gt;&gt;Bridge: factory() 初次进入组合&#10;    Bridge-&gt;&gt;UIKit: 创建 UIView 实例&#10;    Compose-&gt;&gt;Bridge: update() 参数变化&#10;    Bridge-&gt;&gt;UIKit: 更新 UIView 属性&#10;    Compose-&gt;&gt;Bridge: onDispose() 离开组合&#10;    Bridge-&gt;&gt;UIKit: removeFromSuperview()\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Compose as Compose Runtime\n    participant Bridge as UIKitView Bridge\n    participant UIKit as UIKit View\n\n    Compose-&gt;&gt;Bridge: factory() 初次进入组合\n    Bridge-&gt;&gt;UIKit: 创建 UIView 实例\n    Compose-&gt;&gt;Bridge: update() 参数变化\n    Bridge-&gt;&gt;UIKit: 更新 UIView 属性\n    Compose-&gt;&gt;Bridge: onDispose() 离开组合\n    Bridge-&gt;&gt;UIKit: removeFromSuperview()</pre><h2 id=\"swiftui-互操作\">SwiftUI 互操作</h2><p>对于使用 SwiftUI 的 iOS 项目，可以在 SwiftUI 视图层次中嵌入 Compose 内容，或反过来在 Compose 中嵌入 SwiftUI：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// Swift 侧：在 SwiftUI 中使用 Compose 屏幕&#10;import SharedModule&#10;&#10;struct ContentView: View {&#10;    var body: some View {&#10;        VStack {&#10;            Text(&quot;SwiftUI Header&quot;)&#10;            ComposeViewControllerRepresentable()&#10;                .frame(height: 400)&#10;            Text(&quot;SwiftUI Footer&quot;)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;struct ComposeViewControllerRepresentable: UIViewControllerRepresentable {&#10;    func makeUIViewController(context: Context) -&gt; UIViewController {&#10;        return MainKt.SharedScreen()  // Kotlin 导出的 Compose 屏幕&#10;    }&#10;    func updateUIViewController(_ uiViewController: UIViewController, context: Context) {}&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Swift 侧：在 SwiftUI 中使用 Compose 屏幕</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SharedModule</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ContentView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">View </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> body: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">some</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> View {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        VStack</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            Text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SwiftUI Header\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            ComposeViewControllerRepresentable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">frame</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">height</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">400</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            Text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SwiftUI Footer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ComposeViewControllerRepresentable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">UIViewControllerRepresentable </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> makeUIViewController</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: Context) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> UIViewController {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MainKt.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SharedScreen</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Kotlin 导出的 Compose 屏幕</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> updateUIViewController</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> uiViewController: UIViewController, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: Context) {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"无障碍-accessibility-支持\">无障碍（Accessibility）支持</h2><p>Compose Multiplatform 1.8+ 将 Compose 的 Semantics 树映射到 iOS 的 UIAccessibility 系统：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// commonMain — semantics 声明跨平台一致&#10;@Composable&#10;fun ProductCard(product: Product, onAddToCart: () -&gt; Unit) {&#10;    Card(&#10;        modifier = Modifier.semantics {&#10;            contentDescription = &quot;${product.name}, 价格 ${product.price} 元&quot;&#10;        }&#10;    ) {&#10;        // ...&#10;        IconButton(&#10;            onClick = onAddToCart,&#10;            modifier = Modifier.semantics {&#10;                role = Role.Button&#10;                contentDescription = &quot;将 ${product.name} 加入购物车&quot;&#10;            }&#10;        ) {&#10;            Icon(Icons.Default.AddShoppingCart, contentDescription = null)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// commonMain — semantics 声明跨平台一致</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun ProductCard(product: Product, onAddToCart: () -> Unit) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Card(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        modifier = Modifier.semantics {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            contentDescription = \"${product.name}, 价格 ${product.price} 元\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        IconButton(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            onClick = onAddToCart,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            modifier = Modifier.semantics {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                role = Role.Button</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                contentDescription = \"将 ${product.name} 加入购物车\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Icon(Icons.Default.AddShoppingCart, contentDescription = null)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在 iOS 上，这些 semantics 被自动转换为 VoiceOver 可读取的 <code>UIAccessibilityElement</code> 属性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ios-生命周期与系统集成\">iOS 生命周期与系统集成</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// iosMain — 处理 iOS 应用生命周期&#10;@Composable&#10;fun AppWithLifecycle() {&#10;    val lifecycleOwner = LocalLifecycleOwner.current&#10;&#10;    DisposableEffect(lifecycleOwner) {&#10;        val observer = LifecycleEventObserver { _, event -&gt;&#10;            when (event) {&#10;                Lifecycle.Event.ON_RESUME -&gt; { /* 前台恢复 */ }&#10;                Lifecycle.Event.ON_PAUSE -&gt; { /* 进入后台 */ }&#10;                else -&gt; {}&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;        lifecycleOwner.lifecycle.addObserver(observer)&#10;        onDispose { lifecycleOwner.lifecycle.removeObserver(observer) }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    App()&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// iosMain — 处理 iOS 应用生命周期</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun AppWithLifecycle() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val lifecycleOwner = LocalLifecycleOwner.current</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    DisposableEffect(lifecycleOwner) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val observer = LifecycleEventObserver { _, event -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            when (event) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                Lifecycle.Event.ON_RESUME -> { /* 前台恢复 */ }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                Lifecycle.Event.ON_PAUSE -> { /* 进入后台 */ }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                else -> {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        lifecycleOwner.lifecycle.addObserver(observer)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        onDispose { lifecycleOwner.lifecycle.removeObserver(observer) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    App()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Compose 在 iOS 上通过 Skia + CAMetalLayer 渲染，1.11 版本带来原生文本输入和完整无障碍</li>\n<li>UIKitView 允许嵌入任意 UIKit 控件（地图、WebView、播放器）</li>\n<li>SwiftUI 互操作支持双向嵌入——Compose in SwiftUI 和 UIKit in Compose</li>\n<li>Semantics 树自动映射到 UIAccessibility，VoiceOver 体验接近原生</li>\n<li>iOS 生命周期通过 Jetpack Lifecycle KMP 库统一管理</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"compose-multiplatform-fundamentals\">Compose Multiplatform 基础</a>——Compose 的跨平台渲染架构</li>\n<li><a href=\"adaptive-layout-navigation\">自适应布局与导航</a>——iPhone/iPad 不同屏幕的适配</li>\n<li><a href=\"../cross-platform-development/cross-platform-fundamentals/platform-abstraction\">跨平台开发：平台抽象层</a>——UIKit 嵌入与其他框架的原生桥对比</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Compose 与 iOS 平台整合","id":"compose-与-ios-平台整合"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"原生文本输入（Native Text Input）","id":"原生文本输入-native-text-input"},{"level":2,"text":"UIKit 控件嵌入","id":"uikit-控件嵌入"},{"level":2,"text":"SwiftUI 互操作","id":"swiftui-互操作"},{"level":2,"text":"无障碍（Accessibility）支持","id":"无障碍-accessibility-支持"},{"level":2,"text":"iOS 生命周期与系统集成","id":"ios-生命周期与系统集成"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"Compose Multiplatform 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-multiplatform/ui/compose-multiplatform-fundamentals"},"next":{"title":"自适应布局与导航","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-multiplatform/ui/adaptive-layout-navigation"}}